Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:03:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] oblivios: copy the owner's display and lock-screen
 settings to the Duress decoy at the switch

Brightness, screen timeout (30 s against 30 min), rotation and lock-screen toggles differed between the owner and the decoy, so the screen changed at the switch (measured on lynx 2026-11-12). The values are copied one way, owner to decoy, before switchToUserSilently; a key the owner lacks is skipped and a refused write is logged by key.
