+     * ObliviOS: the owner's brightness, screen timeout, rotation and lock-screen toggles are
+     * copied to the decoy before the switch to it, so the screen does not change at the switch
+     * (DUR-037). One way, owner to decoy; only runs on the decoy route, so a device without a
